      "title": "DirittiOk · Your benefits in Italy: bonuses, ISEE, rights",
      "desc": "Find bonuses and public benefits in Italy (ADI, Assegno Unico, bill discounts), see what's left each month and estimate ISEE 2027. Free, data on your phone.",
      "url": "https://dirittiok.com/en",
