      "main": "\n      <section class=\"card\">\n        <h1>Results</h1>\n        <p>You have not entered any data yet. It only takes a few minutes.</p>\n        <p>After the guided steps, you will find here your <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">ISEE</span> estimate, the money left to live on and the <a href=\"/en/diritti-pa\">benefits you may be entitled to</a>.</p>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/en/stima\">Start the estimate</a>\n      </section>\n      <div class=\"disclaimer\" role=\"note\"><strong>Please note:</strong> This is a rough estimate based on the rules known in November 2026. Official values come only from the <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">DSU</span> (the <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">ISEE</span> declaration) submitted to <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">INPS</span> or a <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">CAF</span> (tax assistance centre). Some 2027 amounts are still estimates.</div>\n      <p class=\"small muted aggiornamento\">Last updated: 16 November 2026 · sources checked on <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">INPS</span>, <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">ARERA</span>, <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\">MEF</span>.</p>\n    "
